{
  "schema": 1,
  "name": "Economy log: a High-Risk death chest's losses and their recovery are logged",
  "contract": [
    "With the economy log on, a High-Risk death writes one highrisk_drop row per item that goes into the chest and one for the gold it holds (the lost gold plus any Fel Commutation fee), with the chest's id as source; whoever recovers the chest writes one highrisk_claim row per item taken and one for the gold, with the chest's owner as the other party.",
    "High-Risk character v carries 20 Goretusk Liver (723, its only trade goods) and dies to High-Risk character k; with HighRisk.Losses = 1 and the gear, resource and gold chances at 100 the chest holds the 20 livers, one or more randomly chosen gear pieces (carried or equipped) and a random share of the gold, and k takes all of it. Character o, outside High-Risk, cannot open the chest.",
    "Requires HighRisk.Losses = 1 and HighRisk.GearChance, HighRisk.ResourceChance and HighRisk.GoldChance = 100 in coa.conf (as high-risk-chest-recovery.json)."
  ],
  "timeout_ms": 120000,
